241
00:16:31,540 --> 00:16:33,880
Set your course for Kaivakorp Island.

242
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:37,360
It's on its way right now.

243
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,897
Joey's gonna get help.

244
00:16:38,980 --> 00:16:40,320
I'll go tell Serenity.

245
00:16:42,540 --> 00:16:44,980
I wonder if I can transmit video.

246
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,812
Guess it's worth a shot.

247
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:50,180
Looks like I can watch Seto's duel now.

248
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:52,620
And so can the entire city.

249
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:01,080
You see what I see?

250
00:17:01,820 --> 00:17:03,060
What is that?

251
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:04,637
Look at the monster, Mom.

252
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,440
Oh, that must be a duel.

253
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:09,020
What happened to your cannon, Kaiba?

254
00:17:09,660 --> 00:17:10,490
Tell me!

255
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:15,780
My trap card was able to take
it out of play for one turn.

256
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:17,200
Very clever.

257
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:21,501
It looks like your plan to save
your monster from my attack worked.

258
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:25,380
Well, I've also got a plan,
so I'll play this face down.

259
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:30,720
Now go ahead and make
your move, if you dare.

260
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:32,980
What's wrong, Kaiba?

261
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,700
Did I confuse you?

262
00:17:36,840 --> 00:17:41,428
Yugi just lowered his monster's attack
points by playing a card from his hand.

263
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:44,840
Why would he intentionally
weaken his own monster?

264
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:47,084
Well, what are you waiting for?

265
00:17:47,620 --> 00:17:52,237
It sounds like your adoring fans are
eagerly waiting for you to make a decision,

266
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:53,150
Kaiba.

267
00:17:53,233 --> 00:17:55,237
Slifer is weaker than your monster now.

268
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:56,580
What's your point?

269
00:17:56,980 --> 00:17:58,260
I'm wide open.

270
00:17:58,500 --> 00:18:00,817
You can attack me with
your cannon, right, Kaiba?

271
00:18:00,900 --> 00:18:04,180
Unless you're afraid to attack. Ha!

272
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:08,760
Your scare tactics won't work,
because I know what I have to do.

273
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:10,880
The time has come,

274
00:18:11,620 --> 00:18:13,320
and your time's up.

275
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:18,620
Your Light Force sword is no longer in
effect, so my Egyptian god card is free now.

276
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:23,377
I think you know what's next.

277
00:18:23,460 --> 00:18:27,380
Now I sacrifice my XYZ Dragon Cannon!

278
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:32,000
So I can summon this!

279
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:34,120
Come forth now!

280
00:18:34,660 --> 00:18:36,720
Obelisk the Tormentor!

281
00:18:42,040 --> 00:18:46,040
Use your infinite power
to bring me victory!

282
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:48,860
It's over, Yugi!

283
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,280
Where is it?

284
00:18:56,600 --> 00:18:57,980
Look closely.

285
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:03,300
Here it comes.

286
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:16,780
My mighty Egyptian god
card is here at last.

287
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:20,060
The battle of the gods has begun.

288
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:23,660
But which one will prevail?

289
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:29,020
I hope I can hold my own
against the power of Obelisk!

290
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:31,580
It's definitely not going to be easy!

291
00:19:31,980 --> 00:19:34,060
He's twice as strong as my slifer!

292
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:38,320
Yugi, the Egyptian gods
are about to clash!

293
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:45,060
But only one monster will remain standing!

294
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:49,780
Now it's time to find out which one!

295
00:19:50,060 --> 00:19:51,400
Ha-ha-ha!

296
00:19:58,780 --> 00:20:02,000
Ha-ha-ha!
